'''The Forbidden Bride''' (禁断の花嫁, ''Kindan no Hanayome'', '''The Forbidden Bride''') is the June event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.7 Update|Version 2.2.7]].

==Event==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''The Forbidden Bride'''}} is back in the Battle Cats! Visit the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Legend Stages'''}} to save the wedding from disaster and ensure the newlyweds get their happily ever after!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Available June 1st (11:00am) thru July 1st (10:59am)!'''}}

Get a chance to unlock {{Color|#0000FF|'''Madam Bride'''}} upon clearing any event stage! Your chances will increase greatly if you play later, more difficult stages! (Or get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''100%'''}} chance to collect rewards by using the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Treasure Radar item'''}}!)

※ After you have picked up Madam Bride, unlock it at the {{Color|#34A853|'''Rare Cats'''}} section of the Upgrade menu. If you have collected Madam Bride from a previous event, it cannot be collected again.

